token  action                                stack         output
3      add to output                                       3
+      push operator                         +             3
4      add to output                         +             3 4
*      push operator                         + *           3 4
2      add to output                         + *           3 4 2
/      pop to output, push operator          + /           3 4 2 *
(      push open parenthesis                 + / (         3 4 2 *
1      add to output                         + / (         3 4 2 * 1
-      push operator                         + / ( -       3 4 2 * 1
5      add to output                         + / ( -       3 4 2 * 1 5
)      pop to output until open parenthesis  + /           3 4 2 * 1 5 -
^      push operator                         + / ^         3 4 2 * 1 5 -
2      add to output                         + / ^         3 4 2 * 1 5 - 2
^      push operator                         + / ^ ^       3 4 2 * 1 5 - 2
3      add to output                         + / ^ ^       3 4 2 * 1 5 - 2 3
       pop remaining to output               + / ^         3 4 2 * 1 5 - 2 3 ^
       pop remaining to output               + /           3 4 2 * 1 5 - 2 3 ^ ^
       pop remaining to output               +             3 4 2 * 1 5 - 2 3 ^ ^ /
       pop remaining to output                             3 4 2 * 1 5 - 2 3 ^ ^ / +

3 4 2 * 1 5 - 2 3 ^ ^ / +
